--- !u!114 &1238771258
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1238771257}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 2 | Ders 3 | Oyun D\xF6ng\xFCs\xFC"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin sonundaki durumdur. Kup_KareHizi etkindir. Y\xFCr\xFCtme
    s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6rmek i\xE7in Kup_DonguSirasi nesnesini Inspector'dan
    a\xE7\u0131n.\n\n\u0130ki \u015Feyi kendi g\xF6z\xFCm\xFCzle g\xF6r\xFCyoruz.
    \xD6nce Unity'nin olay fonksiyonlar\u0131n\u0131 hangi s\u0131rayla \xE7a\u011F\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    Console penceresinde okuyoruz. Sonra \xFC\xE7 tu\u015Fla kare h\u0131z\u0131
    ayar\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftiriyor ve Stats panelinde sonucu izliyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders03_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n. Project penceresinde Betikler klas\xF6r\xFCndeki
    DonguSirasi beti\u011Fine \xE7ift t\u0131klay\u0131n ve alt\u0131 fonksiyonu
    okuyun."
  - "DonguSirasi beti\u011Fini Hierarchy'deki k\xFCp\xFCn \xFCzerine s\xFCr\xFCkleyin.
    Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n, yakla\u015F\u0131k iki saniye sonra Pause tu\u015Funa
    bas\u0131n. Console'u en \xFCste kayd\u0131r\u0131n. Awake, OnEnable ve Start
    birer kez yaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r."
  - "Sonraki sat\u0131rlara bak\u0131n. Her karede Update ve LateUpdate bir kez yaz\u0131l\u0131r.
    FixedUpdate baz\u0131 karelerde iki kez g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr, baz\u0131lar\u0131nda
    hi\xE7 g\xF6r\xFCnmez. \xC7\xFCnk\xFC FixedUpdate kareyle de\u011Fil sabit zaman
    ad\u0131m\u0131yla \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131l\u0131r."
  - "Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n. K\xFCpten DonguSirasi bile\u015Fenini kald\u0131r\u0131n
    ve KareHizi beti\u011Fini ekleyin. Game penceresinde Stats d\xFC\u011Fmesini
    a\xE7\u0131n ve Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n."
  - "Game penceresine t\u0131klay\u0131n ve 1 tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. VSync kapan\u0131r,
    FPS de\u011Feri \xE7ok y\xFCkselir. K\xFCp ayn\u0131 h\u0131zda d\xF6nmeye devam
    eder."
  - "2 tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. VSync a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r, FPS de\u011Feri ekran\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n
    yenileme h\u0131z\u0131na iner."
  - "3 tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. FPS de\u011Feri 30 olur. K\xFCp h\xE2l\xE2 ayn\u0131
    h\u0131zda d\xF6ner."
  kendinDene:
  - "KareHizi beti\u011Finde Time.deltaTime \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 silin ve
    1 ile 3 tu\u015Flar\u0131 aras\u0131nda ge\xE7i\u015F yap\u0131n. K\xFCp\xFCn
    d\xF6n\xFC\u015F h\u0131z\u0131 neden de\u011Fi\u015Fiyor?"
  - "DonguSirasi beti\u011Fi ekliyken k\xFCp\xFC Inspector'dan kapat\u0131p a\xE7\u0131n.
    Console'a hangi fonksiyon yeniden yaz\u0131l\u0131yor?"
  - "Edit men\xFCs\xFCnden Project Settings, Time b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCnde Fixed Timestep
    de\u011Ferini 0.02 yerine 0.1 yap\u0131n. FixedUpdate sat\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131n
    s\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131 nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Fiyor? Denemeden sonra de\u011Feri
    0.02 yapmay\u0131 unutmay\u0131n."
